        },
        "quote": "(1) No sign (including the structure or sign surface) shall be erected, installed, altered, relocated, rebuilt, or refaced until a sign permit is issued by the Planning and Development Director.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "d49fc85f-21c3-5aa5-bc34-390ec22ae504",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 292,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:2",
          "start": 214
        },
        "quote": "(2) Only those signs permitted in this chapter shall be granted a sign permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "38743b80-0bac-59cc-aeb3-f1c93bd912e7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 486,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:3",
          "start": 293
        },
        "quote": "(3) Permits shall be issued only to sign hangers licensed by the City or to the property owner, provided the property owner carries public liability insurance with coverage of $500,000 or more.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "a0094cca-517b-5051-9f36-cdd5bf217d91",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 502,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:4",
          "start": 487
        },
        "quote": "(b) Exemptions.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "7752fe71-46bf-5eb6-b6f2-4e4f1235438b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 550,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:5",
          "start": 503
        },
        "quote": "(1) No sign permit is required for maintenance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "126cfa15-bf46-5e51-ae20-ea0f4ec44d46",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 783,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:6",
          "start": 551
        },
        "quote": "(2) Maintenance includes all care and minor repair needed to maintain a safe, attractive and finished structure, frame pole, brackets or surface and which does not enlarge or materially alter any face or display portion of the sign.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "7608af60-430a-5035-9ddb-ace60767d079",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 907,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:7",
          "start": 784
        },
        "quote": "(3) This section does not prevent the maintenance, repainting, or posting of a legally established nonconforming billboard.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6c287664-41d5-5d72-936f-bf6ebaa6b93d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1071,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:8",
          "start": 908
        },
        "quote": "(4) Temporary Signs. A sign permit is required for any temporary balloon sign exceeding 12 cubic feet. A sign permit is not required for all other temporary signs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "acddd9ce-7243-59fe-b443-5435d4a8c5e2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1195,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:9",
          "start": 1072
        },
        "quote": "(5) Repainting/Reposting. The sign surface of a billboard may be repainted or reposted without obtaining a new sign permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "040c3d91-db9f-5630-ae78-39e80a3d51ae",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1242,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:10",
          "start": 1196
        },
        "quote": "(6) A permit is not required for window signs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "a51133da-5c34-58c6-a1a7-3f2617f69e0b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1260,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:11",
          "start": 1243
        },
        "quote": "(c) Applications.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "213afb39-24af-50f2-8cce-b533ad1aae12",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1536,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:12",
          "start": 1261
        },
        "quote": "(1) The Planning and Development Director shall prescribe forms and submittal requirements for sign permits as needed to administer this chapter. The form shall be made available at the Department’s office during regular business hours and on the Department’s public website.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "0312a3ec-33e4-5caf-b55e-6a013db9ea6e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1637,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:13",
          "start": 1537
        },
        "quote": "(2) No sign shall be erected without the prior consent of the owner or the owner’s authorized agent.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "286d474f-952f-5dea-9716-6141ac9ae26a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1786,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:14",
          "start": 1638
        },
        "quote": "(3) At the time the applicant receives the permit the applicant shall pay an application fee in the amount as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "130fae9e-6550-5334-86f6-36779112e62d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1803,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:15",
          "start": 1787
        },
        "quote": "(d) Inspections.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "55ac9f34-9397-5883-82ea-7a2073f256b0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1925,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:16",
          "start": 1804
        },
        "quote": "(1) All signs (including any footings) for which a permit is required are subject to inspection by the Building Official.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.050 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "da5af41f-a2a3-555f-a758-5a9358846f35",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2081,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:17",
          "start": 1926
        },
        "quote": "(2) All signs containing electrical wiring are subject to all applicable provisions of the electrical code adopted by the City. (Ord. 20631 § 57, 1-13-26.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:17#text",
